# VLM2Vec Data Processing Pipeline

## Dataset Structure

### Multi-Modal Data Types
- **Image-Text**: MMEB-train datasets (20+ tasks)
- **Video-Text**: LLaVA-Hound video captioning and QA
- **Visual Document**: Vidore, VisRAG document understanding

### Dataset Configuration
- [experiments/public/train/train_alltasks.yaml](mdc:experiments/public/train/train_alltasks.yaml) - Main dataset mixing configuration
- [experiments/public/data/download_data.sh](mdc:experiments/public/data/download_data.sh) - Data download script

### Dataset Loaders
- [src/data/dataset/mmeb_dataset.py](mdc:src/data/dataset/mmeb_dataset.py) - MMEB image-text dataset processing
- [src/data/dataset/llavahound_dataset_caption.py](mdc:src/data/dataset/llavahound_dataset_caption.py) - Video captioning dataset
- [src/data/dataset/llavahound_dataset_qa.py](mdc:src/data/dataset/llavahound_dataset_qa.py) - Video QA dataset
- [src/data/dataset/vidore_dataset.py](mdc:src/data/dataset/vidore_dataset.py) - Visual document dataset
- [src/data/dataset/visrag_dataset.py](mdc:src/data/dataset/visrag_dataset.py) - Visual RAG dataset

### Data Processing Components
- [src/data/loader/mixed_dataset.py](mdc:src/data/loader/mixed_dataset.py) - Multi-dataset interleaving
- [src/data/collator/train_collator.py](mdc:src/data/collator/train_collator.py) - Multi-modal data collation
- [src/data/collator/eval_collator.py](mdc:src/data/collator/eval_collator.py) - Evaluation data collation

## Data Processing Flow

### 1. Dataset Loading
```python
# Dataset configuration in YAML
dataset_name: TIGER-Lab/MMEB-train
subset_name: ImageNet_1K
dataset_split: original
image_dir: vlm2vec_train/MMEB-train/image
num_sample_per_subset: 100000
weight: 1
```

### 2. Multi-Modal Input Processing
- Text: Tokenization with special tokens for images/videos
- Images: Resize and convert to tensor format
- Videos: Extract frames and process as image sequences
- Documents: Process as multi-page images

### 3. Data Collation
- Batch multiple samples together
- Handle variable-length sequences
- Apply padding and attention masks
- Process multi-modal inputs (text + visual)

## Key Data Processing Features

### Image Processing
- Support for different resolutions (high: 1344x1344, mid: 672x672, low: 128x128)
- Smart resizing with aspect ratio preservation
- Image decay factor for progressive resolution reduction

### Video Processing
- Frame extraction (default: 8 frames per video)
- Middle frame selection for single-frame processing
- Support for video captioning and QA tasks

### Document Processing
- Multi-page document handling
- OCR text extraction and alignment
- Visual document retrieval tasks

## Data Loading Tips
- Use lazy loading for large image datasets
- Implement proper error handling for corrupted data
- Support distributed data loading across multiple workers
- Cache processed data for faster training
